AArch64 SPSC-MP
"Message passing: producer writes slot then publishes head with STLR (Release);
 consumer reads head with LDAR (Acquire) and then the slot. Forbidden outcome:
 consumer sees the new head (X2=1) but the stale slot (X0=0)."
{
0:X1=slot; 0:X3=head;
1:X1=slot; 1:X3=head;
}
 P0            | P1            ;
 MOV W0,#1     | LDAR W2,[X3]  ;
 STR W0,[X1]   | LDR W0,[X1]   ;
 MOV W2,#1     |               ;
 STLR W2,[X3]  |               ;
exists
(1:X2=1 /\ 1:X0=0)
